Dear Hiring Team,

I am excited to apply for the *Software Engineer, IS&T Early Career Opportunities* role at *Apple*. I bring more than three years of professional software engineering experience and an MS in Computer Science, with hands-on work building server-side services in Java and Python, customer-facing web applications in JavaScript and TypeScript, and cloud systems on AWS and GCP. This combination directly supports IS&T's work operating consequential enterprise and customer technology at global complexity and immense scale.

At Sperse, I built Python and FastAPI services for a multi-agent CRM platform serving more than 10,000 users and developed a JavaScript/TypeScript and React workflow application backed by Temporal and Redis for durable, real-time execution. I also engineered a FastMCP service exposing over 160 secure backend actions and led CI/CD and trace-based evaluation work that detected latency, accuracy, and safety regressions before production. These accomplishments reflect the end-to-end ownership, Computer Science Fundamentals, and quantitative problem solving needed to build reliable solutions in IS&T's rapidly growing and dynamic setting.

