Apple's focus on innovation, collaboration, and serving others resonates with how I approach engineering. I am especially drawn to Apple's commitment to privacy and inclusion: building technology that keeps data safe while creating a culture where everyone belongs. I would welcome the opportunity to bring disciplined engineering, leadership through ownership, and a commitment to reliable systems to Apple's IS&T organization. I can be reached at #ph or #eml. Thank you for your time and consideration.

